  "content": "<p>精致存储(Refined Storage)为JEI(Just Enough Items)提供了可选集成模组，增强了合成与配方交互功能。</p>\n\n<h2>合成网格中的配方转移</h2>\n<p>您可以直接将JEI中的配方转移至<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fviewing-resources%252fcrafting-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成网格</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>材料不足？系统仍会放置现有材料</li>\n<li>若缺失材料支持自动合成，可直接从预览界面启动自动合成任务</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://refinedmods.com/jei-crafting-grid-transfer.bed892df.png\" alt=\"JEI合成网格转移界面\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://refinedmods.com/jei-crafting-grid-transfer-preview.a76766f4.png\" alt=\"JEI合成网格转移预览\"></p>\n\n<h2>样板网格中的配方转移</h2>\n<p>JEI配方也可转移至<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fautocrafting%252fpattern-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">样板网格</a>，界面将标注可自动合成的材料。</p>\n\n<h2>R/U键支持</h2>\n<p>在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fviewing-resources%252fgrid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">资源网格</a>和过滤槽位使用R键查看配方，U键查看用途。</p>\n\n<h2>配方查看器同步</h2>\n<p>支持JEI与<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fviewing-resources%252fgrid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">资源网格</a>的搜索框同步：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单向同步（资源网格→JEI）</li>\n<li>双向同步</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://refinedmods.com/jei-sync.bc1d0331.png\" alt=\"资源网格中的JEI同步\"></p>\n\n<h2>幽灵物品拖拽</h2>\n<p>可将JEI中的任意材料拖拽至精致存储的过滤槽位。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://refinedmods.com/jei-ghost-dragging.66c33644.png\" alt=\"JEI幽灵物品拖拽演示\"></p>\n\n<h2>避让区域</h2>\n<p>JEI元素会自动调整位置以避免与精致存储的GUI组件重叠。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
